OL,3,GNEWSAPCs mocked after man, 92, Tasered,
OL,4,Ahearing told
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers were mocked after a
OL,7,F92-year-old amputee was Tasered at a
OL,8,Fcare home in East Sussex, a gross
OL,9,Fmisconduct hearing has been told.
OL,11,FDonald Burgess, who had dementia, was
OL,12,FPava sprayed and Tasered in his
OL,13,Fwheelchair during an incident at the
OL,14,FPark Beck care home in St
OL,15,FLeonards-on-Sea in June 2022.
OL,17,FPC Stephen Smith and PC Rachel Comotto,
OL,18,Fwho were both acquitted of assault
OL,19,Foccasioning actual bodily harm in May
OL,20,F2025, had been called to the home after
OL,21,FBurgess threatened carers with a dinner
OL,22,Fknife.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
