OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPCs mocked after man, 92, Tasered,
OL,4,Ahearing told
OL,5,
OL,6,FComotto, 37, told the hearing at Sussex
OL,7,FPolice HQ in Lewes that other officers
OL,8,Fthroughout Hastings police station
OL,9,F"were laughing and joking at my expense
OL,10,Ffor deploying a Taser in a care home".
